  "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/2068\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/2068</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/2068\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=Hzi&amp;datanum=2068\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/2068\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/2068\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>신문주 선생님께서 만들어주신 zep 맵의 오브젝트를 눌러보며 작성할 수 있는 활동지를 만들어 수업했습니다.</p><p>zep에 대한 간단한 안내와 qr코드도 첨부했습니다. 학생들이 어느때보다 높은 몰입도로 수업에 참여한 수업이었습니다!!</p><p>저도 감사한 마음으로 활동지 공유합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>좋은 맵 공유해주신 선생님 감사합니다.^^</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5c14b75a9e37b489c66057ae04374c3df90f509?download\" data-file-name=\"소화 활동지.hwp\" data-file-size=\"109056\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D284%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20240229220455&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fd5c14b75a9e37b489c66057ae04374c3df90f509')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">소화 활동지</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">106.50KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>+) 글씨체는 강원교육모두체를 활용했습니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.gwe.go.kr/main/content.do?key=m2307211207715\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.gwe.go.kr/main/content.do?key=m2307211207715</a></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
